<article class="env-lemma" id="095D">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/095D">Lemma <span data-tag="095D">59.64.7</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a scheme. Let $\Lambda $ be a ring. The tensor product of two locally constant sheaves of $\Lambda $-modules on $X_{\acute{e}tale}$ is a locally constant sheaf of $\Lambda $-modules. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
